{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"哥林多前書","commonName":"哥林多前書","title":"哥林多前書","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"0cdb14c923aff381b09454e4d34094093fd60a38a1930509fc7d598983c0820b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["愛的真諦"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我就算能說人類和天使的各種語言，如果沒有愛，也不過是咣咣作響的鑼和鈸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我就算能作先知講道，又明白各種奧祕，而且知識淵博，甚至有移開山嶺的信心，如果沒有愛，也一無是處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我就算傾家蕩產賙濟窮人，甚至捨己捐軀任人焚燒",{"noteId":16},"，如果沒有愛，也一無所獲。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["愛是恆久忍耐，又有恩慈；愛是不嫉妒，不自吹自擂，不驕傲自大，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["不魯莽無禮，不自私自利，不輕易動怒，不懷怨記恨，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["不喜愛不義，只喜愛真理；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["凡事能包容，凡事有信心，凡事有盼望，凡事能忍耐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["愛永不止息。然而，先知講道的恩賜終會過去，說方言的恩賜也會停止，知識也將成為過去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我們現在知道的有限，作先知所講的也有限，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["等那全備的來到，這有限的事都要被廢棄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["當我是小孩子的時候，我的思想、言語和推理都像小孩子，長大後，我就把一切幼稚的事丟棄了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["如今我們好像對著鏡子觀看影像，模糊不清，但將來會面對面。現在我所知道的有限，但將來會完全知道，如同主知道我一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["如今常存的有信、望、愛這三樣，其中最偉大的是愛。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"「捨己捐軀任人焚燒」有古卷作「為了誇口而捨己捐軀」。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}